{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>近日IG出現一位皮膚超白嘅正妹，獨自駕船出海影片，當中極具衝擊力的「黃金畫面」在網上討論區引發哄動！大家都急求 …</p><p></p>\n<p>近日IG出現一位皮膚超白嘅正妹，獨自駕船出海影片，當中極具衝擊力的「黃金畫面」在網上討論區引發哄動！大家都急求靚女IG是什麼！</p>\n<h2>港女希臘自駕出海大騷世界級身材</h2>\n<p>經常分享出海照片的IG素人美女Connie，近日上傳了一段在希臘海域獨自駕駛船隻的短片。她在影片中透露這次行程沒有太多預先計劃，僅在前一日於當地預訂船隻，便成功出海航行長達3小時並欣賞日落美景。畫面中最令人矚目是她換上一件黑色吊帶前交叉款式比堅尼，心口大開完美展現世界級豐滿身材！</p>\n<h2>女主角福利超多 親自回覆泳衣數量</h2>\n<p>震撼影片曝光後迅速在各大討論區廣泛流傳，早前更有人直接留言發問「Baby，你到底有幾多套泳衣」。她直言「因為旅行買咗好多，多到我都唔記得」。Connie過往不時分享穿著不同款式水著出海的動態，每次登場均換上全新設計，非常養眼。</p>\n<h2>理大設計系畢業曾短暫留學英國</h2>\n<p>Connie於2022年在香港理工大學設計系正式畢業，過去亦曾經有短暫在英國生活的經歷，其目前IG集中分享旅行生活點滴，成功累積2.2萬名粉絲追蹤。她近年對水上活動情有獨鍾，經常出海追蹤海豚蹤跡，同時不斷上傳各種風格的泳裝照片回饋大批支持者。</p>\n<h2>網絡討論區狂讚：呢條女99分</h2>\n<p>不少網民看過影片後連環大讚「師姐少正」，直指其具備港女罕見的白滑特質，並留言表示「明明港女白滑係賣點」。討論區內充斥著各種高度評價，有人激讚她「又後生又長腿又身材頂級」，直言「呢條女99分」，同時亦有不少新網民四處查問「呢個ig係咩」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553152922814005_9322887046b05a30991246.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553152922814005_9322887046b05a30991246.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>經常分享出海照片的IG素人美女Connie，近日上傳了一段在希臘海域獨自駕駛船隻的短片。（圖片來源：IG@chanpeihang）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553153019196369_6860792886b05a30a89216.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553153019196369_6860792886b05a30a89216.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>她近年對水上活動情有獨鍾，經常出海追蹤海豚蹤跡，同時不斷上傳各種風格的泳裝照片回饋大批支持者。（圖片來源：IG@chanpeihang）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553153351829168_10546322096b05a30dd2a40.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-3\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553153351829168_10546322096b05a30dd2a40.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>累積2.2萬名粉絲追蹤。（圖片來源：IG@chanpeihang）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553153529240167_8378066066b05a30fbb36c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553153529240167_8378066066b05a30fbb36c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有人發問「Baby，你到底有幾多套泳衣」。她直言「因為旅行買咗好多，多到我都唔記得」。（圖片來源：IG@chanpeihang）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553153849466152_2125046786b05a3130870e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553153849466152_2125046786b05a3130870e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有人激讚她「又後生又長腿又身材頂級」，直言「呢條女99分」（圖片來源：IG@chanpeihang）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553154142369207_4575907876b05a315efda8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553154142369207_4575907876b05a315efda8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Connie於2022年在香港理工大學設計系正式畢業。（圖片來源：IG@chanpeihang）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553154337934010_20454778436b05a317b87c1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179553154337934010_20454778436b05a317b87c1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@chanpeihang）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%af%94%e5%a0%85%e5%b0%bc/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">比堅尼</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b8%af%e5%a5%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">港女</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%90%86%e5%a4%a7%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">理大女神</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%b6%b2%e7%b4%85/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">網紅</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3549542\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 24 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:03:52.963230+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1350,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T14:45:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T23:57:53.817065+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:57:24.941678+00:00","content_hash":"b58fafc5ff7dd56b23dbb414dab5eab7391658c69caedfbbcde0a7574824f539","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}